// Inflate - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# Inflate is the inverse of deflate: it turns the stream below back into
# "Hello World!". Inflate emits no bytes of its own, so what is shown here
# is the deflate stream it would consume.
0000  F3 48 CD C9 C9 57 08 CF 2F CA 49 51 04 00       |.H...W../.IQ..|
